<title>USA: Payless Cashways March same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Payless Cashways March same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		 $232	 $234	-0.8	 +1.4</p>
<p>Year-to-date	$720	 $761	-5.4	 -2.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is	5 weeks ended	 April 5.</p>
<p>NOTE: Adjusted for Easter and presented on comparable store basis to last year, March total sales would have increased 1.3 percent and March same-store sales would have increased 3.5 percent. March of FY97 includes one less sales day due to the Easter holiday on March 30.</p>
<p>Full co name is Payless Cashways Inc.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
